			"notes": "- The mod now distinguishes between a standard Rate Limit and a Paid Key Requirement. Players will get a warning message if they try to use a Pro model with a free API key.\n- The time for \"Still thinking\" message to appear was increased.\n- Improvements in the context history preservation of the models.\n- Added color to the \"@gemini\" prefix in the player chat message.\n- Minor adjustments in the help menu design."
